c=AdqilSRm_4ZOkfzs6kRwnfYjJRQnwhNzN5L_FNSE1fVNuTOtud_1IXvH5XQwKBTeA0Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7GW4QbVNGB1zO9IU6QShEZwUK1H_9Kk16bpmR5m359zQ&oe=6A09E1CE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "BPX_StoreAssets_Mar2026_CoverLandscape_2560x1440_c.png", "id": "2659770077742528", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619646_2659770087742527_908505703936013988_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BvKYd8zFMTAQ7kNvwES_U_F&_nc_oc=AdoaxJJCUPnkM5iQyoSJwKoPwMHpYhCj0IvbTi68g6eeH8pIe31wDwmgxUVYLq3h_04&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4-KR430ax5DW9oCiyTKEXQAa2cH60L2eKr8U9PPVh87Q&oe=6A09CED0"}, "display_name": "BuildPort Xumia", "keywords": ["social", "sandbox", "crafting", "spaceship", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# **Epic space battles are better in ships & weapons that you build \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5\ud83e\udd47**\n\n**BuildPort Xumia** is the ultimate physics-based social combat game where creativity and skills matter!\n- Build spaceships and hand-held weapons your way\n- Battle against others in PvP and Co-op modes\n- Defend against waves of enemies in Core Siege mode by yourself or with friends\n- Climb leaderboards and prove your worth\n\nEvery match is different and every build is uniquely yours. \n\n{1836199927060120}\n\n**Build. Battle. Go Solo or Team up.**\n\nBuildPort Xumia is an ever evolving sandbox where your imagination and skills shape the outcome!\n\n{2003865910342450}\n\n**NEW: Hand Weapons. You can now build hand-weapons and blast both enemies and friends without being in the cockpit.**\n\n- Build unique hand weapons using wide variety of parts\n- Fast, creative, and instantly fun for players who don't like to fly\n- It\u2019s a completely new way to play Xumia.\n\n{1223491569605010}\n\n**NEW: Multi-Cockpit Co-Op**\n\nYou no longer have to fly alone.\nJump into the same ship with your friends and take on challenges together:\n- One pilot. One gunner.\n- Coordinate your strategy\n\nAvailable in Core Siege and the Rift.\n{1338865624720231}\n\n**NEW Arenas to Explore**\n\nTake your creations into brand new environments!\n- The Lava Pit: high-risk, high-reward battles\n- Social BuildPort: build together with others\n- The Rift: refine your builds and hone your skills\n\n{1749249276457790}\n\n**Build. Battle. Explore with Friends.**", "short_description": "# **Epic space battles are better in ships that you build \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca5\ud83e\udd47**\n\n**BuildPort Xumia** Build your own ship or hand-weapon. Epic PvP social battles in stunning world! \n\n- Build spaceships and hand-held weapons your way\n- Battle against others in PvP and Co-op modes\n- Defend against waves of enemies in Core Siege mode by yourself or with friends\n- Climb leaderboards and prove your worth\n\nEvery match is different and every build is uniquely yours.\n \n**Build. Battle. Explore with Friends.**"}]}, "developer_name": "Yumebau Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://buildport.xumia.io/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://buildport.xumia.io/terms-of-use", "publisher_name": "Yumebau Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://buildport.xumia.io/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "275629210202852"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "s